s, chill zones, and places to mess around with friends. \ud83e\uddd7\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Whether you're racing to the top or just hanging out, there's always something new to find. No swinging\u2014just pure climbing, exploring, and vibing. \ud83c\udf3f\u2728 With smooth movement, multiplayer fun, and a laid-back feel, Monkey Up is all about good times and monkey business. \ud83c\udf4c\ud83c\udfae\n", "short_description": "MonkeyUp by Monk"}]}, "developer_name": "MONKSTUDIOS", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/monkeyup/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Monk", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/y7z3VJrMHW", "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/monkeyup/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "25309365608650491"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1488013655969708"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1488013655969708"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1754583840, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1488013655969708"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "25365696779684040", "version": "0.55"}, "id": "1188570883067034", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_b